      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784924068265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Next.js 15 (App Router) | React 19 | TypeScript\nRedux Toolkit | Tailwind CSS 4 | Radix UI\nNextAuth v4 (Google / Facebook / Apple)\n\nPages: auth, dashboard, admin, client, specialist\nAPI Client: auto-retry, JWT attach, 401 redirect\nWebSocket: live booking status + ETA\nMiddleware: route protection (guest / user / admin)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Next.js 15 (App Router) | React 19 | TypeScript\nRedux Toolkit | Tailwind CSS 4 | Radix UI\nNextAuth v4 (Google / Facebook / Apple)\n\nPages: auth, dashboard, admin, client, specialist\nAPI Client: auto-retry, JWT attach, 401 redirect\nWebSocket: live booking status + ETA\nMiddleware: route protection (guest / user / admin)",
