      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784924080379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FastAPI (Python 3.13) | 14 Routers\nSQLAlchemy ORM | Alembic Migrations\nCelery + Redis | JWT (PyJWT + bcrypt)\n\nRouters: auth, users, workers, bookings, marketplace,\n  userinput, intent, services, admin, assistant,\n  messages, ai_chat, payments, location_permission\n\nWebSocket + SSE streaming | httpx async",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FastAPI (Python 3.13) | 14 Routers\nSQLAlchemy ORM | Alembic Migrations\nCelery + Redis | JWT (PyJWT + bcrypt)\n\nRouters: auth, users, workers, bookings, marketplace,\n  userinput, intent, services, admin, assistant,\n  messages, ai_chat, payments, location_permission\n\nWebSocket + SSE streaming | httpx async",
